# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Big files. Kept out on purpose, not by accident.
#
# All of these can be rebuilt from the scripts in this repo, and together they
# are ~500MB, which would make every clone slow forever. See
# WHERE_I_LEFT_OFF.txt for the exact commands to regenerate each one.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# The trained DistilBERT. 255MB for model.safetensors alone, which is over
# GitHub's 100MB per-file hard limit, so this CANNOT be pushed without git-lfs.
# Rebuild: train_reading_model_v3.ipynb on Colab (~40 min), then tune_cutoff.py.
analyzer/reading_model/

# The old TF-IDF word-counter. Rebuild: python train_honest_model.py
analyzer/model.pkl
analyzer/vectorizer.pkl
analyzer/model_meta.json

# Training and test data, ~206MB.
#   Fake.csv, True.csv          ISOT, from Kaggle
#   fake_or_real_news.csv       McIntire -- THE EXAM
#   diverse_fakes.csv           python fetch_diverse_fakes.py
#   diverse_reals.csv           python fetch_diverse_reals.py
*.csv

# The fact-check database, 45MB. Rebuild: python load_mega_data.py
db.sqlite3

